Bad: 
IP starts with 169.254.x.x (Link Local): DHCP failed (no IP assigned)
Release and renew IP: 
cmd:
ipconfig /release
ipconfig /renew

If Gateway is missing - PC cannot reach the router - no internet
Check router and reconnect to the network // router power + connection 
If necessary, set the gateway manually in IPv4 properties.




